<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Platform Admin — システム管理</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/static/images/logo1.png" type="image/png">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0a0812;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 20%, rgba(124,58,237,0.12) 0%, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 80%, rgba(99,102,241,0.09) 0%, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.06) 0%, transparent 40%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    /* Grid decoration */
    body::after {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(124,58,237,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(124,58,237,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 48px 48px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .login-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* Top badge */
    .sys-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .sys-badge-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(124,58,237,0.5), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .sys-badge-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: #fff; fill: none; stroke-width: 1.8; }
    .sys-badge-label {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .sys-badge-name {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .sys-badge-sub {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #7c3aed;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Card */
    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.035);
      border: 1px solid rgba(124,58,237,0.18);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px 28px 28px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset,
        0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
        0 0 40px rgba(124,58,237,0.06);
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .card-subtitle {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #475569;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* Error */
    #error {
      display: none;
      background: rgba(220,38,38,0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      color: #fca5a5;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    /* Fields */
    .field { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #64748b;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .input-wrap { position: relative; }
    .field input {
      width: 100%;
      height: 46px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0 44px 0 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .field input::placeholder { color: #334155; }
    .field input:focus {
      background: rgba(124,58,237,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(124,58,237,0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
    }
    .toggle-btn {
      position: absolute;
      right: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 4px;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #475569;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }
    .toggle-btn:hover { color: #94a3b8; }
    .toggle-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; stroke: currentColor; fill: none; stroke-width: 2; }

    /* Submit */
    #loginBtn {
      width: 100%;
      height: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #4f46e5 100%);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 6px;
      transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(124,58,237,0.4);
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    #loginBtn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      opacity: 0.9;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(124,58,237,0.5);
    }
    #loginBtn:active:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(0); }
    #loginBtn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; box-shadow: none; }

    /* Status / footer */
    #status {
      min-height: 28px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #475569;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .card-footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .card-footer a {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #4f46e5;
      text-decoration: none;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transition: opacity 0.15s;
    }
    .card-footer a:hover { opacity: 1; }

    /* Warning box */
    .access-warning {
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: rgba(239,68,68,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.18);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .access-warning svg {
      width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;
      stroke: #f87171; fill: none; stroke-width: 2;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .access-warning-body { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; }
    .access-warning-body strong { display: block; color: #f87171; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 2px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .access-warning-ip {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding-top: 8px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.12);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .access-warning-ip span {
      font-family: monospace;
      color: #a78bfa;
      background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* Spinner */
    .page-spinner {
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(10,8,18,0.88);
      display: grid; place-items: center; z-index: 3000;
    }
    .page-spinner[hidden] { display: none; }
    .lds-spinner { display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 48px; height: 48px; }
    .lds-spinner div { transform-origin: 24px 24px; animation: lds-sp 1.2s linear infinite; }
    .lds-spinner div:after {
      content: ''; display: block; position: absolute;
      top: 2px; left: 22px; width: 4px; height: 10px;
      border-radius: 20%; background: #7c3aed;
    }
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(0);animation-delay:-1.1s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(30deg);animation-delay:-1s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(60deg);animation-delay:-.9s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(4){transform:rotate(90deg);animation-delay:-.8s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(5){transform:rotate(120deg);animation-delay:-.7s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(6){transform:rotate(150deg);animation-delay:-.6s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(7){transform:rotate(180deg);animation-delay:-.5s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(8){transform:rotate(210deg);animation-delay:-.4s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(9){transform:rotate(240deg);animation-delay:-.3s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(10){transform:rotate(270deg);animation-delay:-.2s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(11){transform:rotate(300deg);animation-delay:-.1s}
    .lds-spinner div:nth-child(12){transform:rotate(330deg);animation-delay:0s}
    @keyframes lds-sp { 0%{opacity:1} to{opacity:0} }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .card { padding: 24px 20px; border-radius: 14px; }
      .login-wrap { padding: 16px 12px; }
    }
  </style>
  <script type="module" src="/static/js/pages/platform-login.page.js?v=20260916-1"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="pageSpinner" class="page-spinner" hidden>
    <div class="lds-spinner"><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="login-wrap">
    <div class="sys-badge">
      <div class="sys-badge-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/>
          <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/>
          <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="sys-badge-label">
        <span class="sys-badge-name">TosouApp</span>
        <span class="sys-badge-sub">Platform Admin</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">システム管理ポータル</div>
      <div class="card-subtitle">AUTHORIZED ACCESS ONLY</div>

      <div id="error" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></div>

      <form id="loginForm" novalidate>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="email">メールアドレス</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <input id="email" name="login_email" type="email"
              placeholder="admin@example.com"
              autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="password">パスワード</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <input id="password" name="login_password" type="password"
              placeholder="••••••••"
              autocomplete="off" required>
            <button type="button" id="togglePassword" class="toggle-btn" aria-label="パスワードを表示"></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" id="loginBtn" disabled>ログイン</button>
      </form>
      <div id="status"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="access-warning">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
      <div class="access-warning-body">
        <strong>AUTHORIZED ACCESS ONLY</strong>
        このページへのアクセスおよびログイン操作はすべて記録されます。不正アクセスは法的措置の対象となります。
        <div class="access-warning-ip">
          接続元IP:
          <span><%= clientIp || '取得中...' %></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-footer">
      <a href="/ui/login">← 通常ログイン画面へ</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
